  <p id="c-nanshi-016-wangkuan-xuanmo:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanshi-016-wangkuan-xuanmo:p001:m0000" ref="31b_fd1_f77_A">深</persName>弟<persName id="c-nanshi-016-wangkuan-xuanmo:p001:m0002" ref="31b_fd1_f77_B">寬</persName>，泰始初，爲隨郡太守。逢四方反，父<persName id="c-nanshi-016-wangkuan-xuanmo:p001:m0020" ref="31b_fd1_f77">玄謨</persName>在建鄴，<persName id="c-nanshi-016-wangkuan-xuanmo:p001:m0026" ref="31b_fd1_f77_B">寬</persName>棄郡自歸。以<rs id="c-nanshi-016-wangkuan-xuanmo:p001:u-mother" type="unresolved">母</rs>在西，爲賊所執，請西行，遂襲破隨郡，收其母。事平，明帝嘉之，使圖<persName id="c-nanshi-016-wangkuan-xuanmo:p001:m0066" ref="31b_fd1_f77_B">寬</persName>形以上。齊永明元年，爲太常，坐于宅殺牛，免官。後卒于光祿大夫。</p>
</text>
